<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>If you’re happy and you know it,</l><l>Stomp your feet.</l><l>(stomp, stomp)</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>If you’re happy and you know it,</l><l>Call, “Oh, Lord“.</l><l>(Oh, Lord)</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>If you’re happy and you know it,</l><l>Say, “Amen“.</l><l>(Amen)</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>If you’re happy and you know it,</l><l>Do all four.</l><l>(clap, clap; stomp, stomp; Oh, Lord; Amen.)</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
